Hi YKE,

The problem you describe below sounds like there was an issue with the installation of the GTK+ package.

How was that installed? (It is a separate install to R and Rattle but is picked up to be installed when Rattle starts up the first time)

Are you able to uninstall the GTK+ package and try installing it again perhaps?

Regards,
Graham

