GTK+ is the non-R and non-Rattle package that provides the GUI.

RGtk2 is the R package that provides the interface to the GTK+ library.

It looks like you have RGtk2 (and thus GTK+) installed properly now (else you would get no GUI interface).

The problem with the plotting looks like an issue.

Could you provide the steps/data you undertake to repeat the error and provide the error message.

Does it only happen when you load a .rattle project file?

Thanks,
Graham

